 "inter": [],
 "structural_change": "r9c (HBM-SFU9 10-17, coordinator HANDOFF 0db rejected r9 leaf2: clock + every pin on the W face of 425x194, TT insertion 525 / spread 160): COLUMN leaf, 6 SRAMs as one abutted N-S stack, all R0, so every macro A edge (clk, rd_out, addr, wd_in[0:135]) faces ONE W band that holds the register mass (cfg copy low half, captured, calendar, stripe control) and every B edge (wd_in[136:255] + ties) faces a thin E band. Each data bit has ONE physical destination side: in_data_lo[135:0] W face, in_data_hi[119:0] E face over its full length (wrapper port split only, bit-identical). Stripe pages are vertically adjacent (page mux local). Pins spread over the full W and E faces (M4), each stripe calendar leaves at its own rows, clock pin at W mid-height beside the register mass. Outline 298.08 x 470.88 (1.58:1). Cycles unchanged vs r9.",
